      "mergeID": "633c5eb78a3df744b78711b5",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The new menu has a lot of smaller ui elements and a smaller text size than the old menu. This is fine on index/quest, but is kinda difficult to use on low resolution headsets like the Original Vive/Rift. The menu looks blurry and some elements are harder to read with how far away it is. \nIt would significantly improve the experience if we could move the menu closer to us when it's unlocked. Either by letting us manually drag it closer to us. Or when it's grabbed, let us press up/down on the right joystick to move it closer/farther away.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Allow the main menu to be moved closer to improve readability on low res headsets",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6319c35ed042b344ab87977f",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
