      "mergeID": "6345dbfe110e59724f83d5c9",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Thank you for all your development.\nI would like to see the UI 2.0 menu screen be allowed to change size or allow forwards and backwards in distance, preferably like a 'personal mirror'.\nCurrently, the display is basically at a fixed distance, which can be inconvenient when you want to get a closer look.\nIt would be great if it were possible to move back and forth with the stick, like in 'Personal Mirror', but it could also be done in a similar way to moving around in Grub.\nPlease consider this.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Enabling the main menu to change the magnification rate, or the distance backwards or forwards",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6319c35ed042b344ab87977f",
