  "details": "The current moveable menu is difficult to use without turning your head frequently, which is difficult for VR users with chronic pain and fatigue.\n*Currently, the only method of adjusting distance is to* **lean forward** *whilst adjusting the main menu.*\n**Please add the ability to adjust the distance from the player, using the left or right sticks, whilst the moveable menu is held.**\n*Additionally, have the moveable menu remember its positioning on subsequent launches, and allow resetting its position via an option in Quick Menu settings.*",
